Cell["\<\
The alphabet of the Heisenberg nilmanifold has eight letters, of which one \
carries a differential; these are all the words of length at most two on \
which it is nonzero:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"68e470e4-36c1-4a49-aada-e6385a338dc9"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
