Cell["\<\
Kodaira-Thurston is the Heisenberg nilmanifold crossed with a circle, and its \
quotient carries two differential entries rather than one \[LongDash] which \
is why it, and not the nilmanifold alone, is what fixes the sign of the \
operation:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"d534f62f-03aa-42ae-bff4-ce2ba73e50e4"],

